flowchart TD
    MeovoPlugin["Meovo插件"] -->|玩家数据| Scheduler["定时任务(CollectPlayerDataScheduler)"]
    Scheduler -->|转换数据| PlayerDTO["玩家数据传输对象(PlayerDTO)"]
    PlayerDTO -->|持久化| MySQL["MySQL数据库"]
    PlayerDTO -->|缓存| Redis["Redis缓存"]
    
    Client["前端客户端"] -->|API请求| Controller["控制器"]
    Controller -->|调用用例| UseCase["用例"]
    UseCase -->|查询数据| Repository["存储库"]
    Repository -->|优先查询| Redis
    Repository -->|缓存未命中| MySQL
    Repository -->|返回数据| UseCase
    UseCase -->|转换数据| ResponseDTO["响应数据传输对象"]
    ResponseDTO -->|返回响应| Controller
    Controller -->|JSON数据| Client
    
    UserAction["用户操作(发布帖子/评论等)"] -->|触发| Controller
    Controller -->|调用用例| UseCase
    UseCase -->|更新数据| Repository
    Repository -->|写入| MySQL
    Repository -->|更新| Redis
    
    subgraph 数据来源
        MeovoPlugin
        UserAction
    end
    
    subgraph 数据处理层
        Scheduler
        Controller
        UseCase
        Repository
    end
    
    subgraph 数据存储层
        MySQL
        Redis
    end
    
    subgraph 数据传输层
        PlayerDTO
        ResponseDTO
    end
